---
---
<!-- ── LED & AV ── -->
<section class="av-section" id="led-av">
  <div class="av-inner">
    <div class="stag-o">LED & AV Installations</div>
    <h2 class="sh-o">Displays that<br/><em>make an impression.</em></h2>

    <div class="av-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="sb-o" style="margin-bottom:28px;">From a single lobby screen to a full multi-panel LED video wall — we design, source, install, and manage every display in your space. Restaurants, hotels, conference rooms, retail floors, sports bars, houses of worship. If it lights up, we handle it.</p>

        <div class="av-services">
          <div class="av-card">
            <div class="av-card-icon">🏟️</div>
            <h3>Large Format LED Walls</h3>
            <p>Custom-built video wall systems — any size, any resolution. Indoor and outdoor. Direct-view LED panels installed and calibrated to your space.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="av-card">
            <div class="av-card-icon">📺</div>
            <h3>Digital Signage & Menu Boards</h3>
            <p>Professional commercial displays with remote content management. Update your menu, promotions, or messaging from your phone in seconds.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="av-card">
            <div class="av-card-icon">🎙️</div>
            <h3>Conference Room AV</h3>
            <p>Rooms that work every time. Display systems, audio, cameras, and control — designed for video calls that don't make you look like an amateur.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="av-card">
            <div class="av-card-icon">🎵</div>
            <h3>Distributed Audio</h3>
            <p>Whole-space audio systems for restaurants, lobbies, retail, and offices. Zone-controlled, app-managed, professionally installed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="av-card">
            <div class="av-card-icon">🍺</div>
            <h3>Sports Bar & Entertainment</h3>
            <p>Multiple screens, multiple sources, zero headaches. Sports packages, custom layouts, and systems your staff can actually operate.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="av-card">
            <div class="av-card-icon">🏨</div>
            <h3>Lobby & Guest Experience</h3>
            <p>Branded lobby displays, wayfinding screens, and guest-facing technology that sets the tone the moment someone walks in.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dealer pricing card -->
        <div class="av-dealer-card">
          <div class="av-dealer-label">🏷️ Dealer Pricing Perk</div>
          <div class="av-dealer-title">Commercial AV at dealer cost.<br/>Same deal as our hardware.</div>
          <div class="av-dealer-body">We're authorized dealers for the commercial AV and display brands we install. That means you get our dealer pricing on every screen, panel, and component — not retail markup. Most integrators add 30–50% on top. We pass our cost straight to you.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual: animated LED wall simulation -->
      <div>
        <div class="av-visual">
          <div class="av-led-sim" id="led-sim">
          </div>
          <div class="av-screen-label">HowdyNET · Managed Display System</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:20px;background:var(--white);border:1px solid rgba(139,34,0,0.08);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,34,0,0.06);">
          <div style="font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--orange);margin-bottom:10px;">We manage everything after install</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);"><span style="color:var(--orange);">✓</span> Remote content updates from your app</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);"><span style="color:var(--orange);">✓</span> Scheduled content by time or day</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);"><span style="color:var(--orange);">✓</span> 24/7 monitoring — we know before you do</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);"><span style="color:var(--orange);">✓</span> Integrates with your custom HowdyNET app</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--dark);"><span style="color:var(--orange);">✓</span> Multi-location management from one dashboard</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-panel btn-orange" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:16px;display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;background:var(--flame);color:#fff;">Get a Display Quote →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
